.env
.env.local
*.local
.DS_Store
_work/
# A generated descriptions file for `aerie tests describe --from`, derived from
# the test files, applied to /config, and no more part of the repository than
# a run log is.
# The last run's output, written by `aerie tests run` and read back by the
# ingest half. Beside the project because on a node the ingest is relayed and
# the controller reads the path on its own filesystem, and /workspace is the
# one place both machines see.
.bb-test-run.log
# ...and where a run log lands. From a session on a node `aerie tests ingest` is
# relayed, and the controller opens the path it is given, so the log has to
# be somewhere both machines see, which means inside the project.
scratchpad/
# aerie map's index, built from the tree and rebuilt when a source is newer.
.bb-map/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The companion app: Gradle and the build outputs, never the tree. The
# wrapper jar is committed on purpose: it is what makes ./gradlew work.
apps/android/.gradle/
apps/android/build/
apps/android/app/build/
apps/android/local.properties
apps/android/.kotlin/

# What a build produced, for the Artifacts tab and never for history.
dist/

# The agent's release signature: made by a release build (tools/sign-agent.py), in no commit.
scripts/agent/agent.sig
